Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.48,0:00:03.66,Note,0,0,0,0,,（忆往昔）
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.63,0:00:05.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好 艾米\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi, Amy.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.74,0:00:08.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,你了解我 知道我是个什么样的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know me. You know the kind of person I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.49,0:00:10.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,她杀了很多人 所以我们就得杀她\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's dropping bodies, man, which means we got to drop her.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.98,0:00:12.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,她收手了 相信我\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's done. Trust me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.76,0:00:13.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.78,0:00:16.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你改不了你的本性 你还会再杀人的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are what you are. You will kill again.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.31,0:00:17.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你到底怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's going on with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.10,0:00:19.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你改不了你的本性\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are what you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.56,0:00:21.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你究竟想说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.52,0:00:23.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是指你不想说的那件心事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm talking about whatever you're not telling me about.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.24,0:00:24.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你并不想放她走的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you didn't want to let her go,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.18,0:00:25.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,但把她放走是对的\N{\fnArial\fs30}but it was the right thing to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.60,0:00:27.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 谢谢你 - 不客气\N{\fnArial\fs30}- So, thanks. - No problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.20,0:00:29.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道我的座右铭 为人民服务\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know my motto … "Here to help."
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.87,0:00:31.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你是怎么对艾米的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kind of like you helped Amy?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.41,0:00:32.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.15,0:00:35.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还是一个人走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should just go on without me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.77,0:00:38.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.61,0:00:47.33,Note,0,0,0,0,,（如今）
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.75,0:00:50.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.73,0:00:53.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,已经有一个幽灵来到我们身边\N{\fnArial\fs30}A spirit has gathered around us.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.54,0:00:56.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在这儿吗 幽灵\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you with us, spirit?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.51,0:01:06.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我感觉到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I feel something.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.57,0:01:07.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我都起鸡皮疙瘩了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have goose bumps.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.80,0:01:09.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,是丹尼叔叔吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uncle Danny?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.96,0:01:11.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在我们要与他接触了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're going to make contact now.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.17,0:01:14.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,把你们的手放在占卜板上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rest your hands on the planchette.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.20,0:01:18.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,让幽灵来指引它们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let the spirit guide our hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.72,0:01:22.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 幽灵啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}O spirit,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.08,0:01:25.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是我们要找的人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you the one we seek?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.35,0:01:27.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.35,0:01:30.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,丹尼叔叔吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uncle Danny?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.44,0:01:35.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没使劲\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not doing that.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.28,0:01:37.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然 是她在推\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. She's pushing it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.40,0:01:42.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,有所怀疑很正常\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay to be skeptical.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.26,0:01:47.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,丹尼 如果你在这儿的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Danny, if you're with us,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.91,0:01:50.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,请敲两下表示肯定\N{\fnArial\fs30}Knock twice for yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.21,0:01:54.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,丹尼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Danny?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.49,0:01:58.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能问问他 他快乐吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you ask him, is he happy?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.74,0:02:02.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 他很快乐\N{\fnArial\fs30}He is. He's happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.46,0:02:03.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,莎迪跟他在一起吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is Sadie with him?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.63,0:02:05.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真是太离谱了 辛西娅\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now you're being ridiculous, Cynthia.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.69,0:02:06.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁会在乎莎迪啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who cares about Sadie?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.97,0:02:08.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,哎呀 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.05,0:02:10.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I see…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.68,0:02:12.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,一只小宠物\N{\fnArial\fs30}A family pet.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.92,0:02:14.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是她 莎迪是一只雪纳瑞犬\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's her. Sadie was a schnauzer.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.96,0:02:19.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,她跟丹尼 在那边也在追网球玩儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's with Danny, chasing tennis balls in the afterlife.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.55,0:02:21.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,莎迪非常喜欢网球\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sadie loved tennis balls.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.07,0:02:23.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,有一些重要的文件\N{\fnArial\fs30}There were important papers.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.71,0:02:25.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁都找不到 没放在保险箱里\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one can find them. They weren't in the safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.16,0:02:27.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能向他打听下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you just ask him…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.93,0:02:29.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然没问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.89,0:02:33.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你得把手跟我一起放在占卜板上\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll need you to place your hands with me on the planchette.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.66,0:02:42.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe …
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.84,0:02:44.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许是丹尼不太喜欢这个问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}maybe Danny didn't like the question.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.60,0:02:45.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,叫他少跟哥兜圈子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell him to quit fooling around.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.92,0:02:47.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,他心知肚明那可是我的钱\N{\fnArial\fs30}He knows darn well that's my money.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.50,0:02:54.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你俩就不能消停一下吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can't you two stop squabbling?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.56,0:02:56.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托了 他都已经死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}For pete's sake, he's dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.20,0:02:59.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉他我们很抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell him we're sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.68,0:03:01.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许如果我们友好点儿 他就能\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe if we're nice, he'll …
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.72,0:03:05.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,偶滴神啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my god.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.02,0:03:06.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,丹尼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Danny?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.79,0:03:09.30,Note,0,0,0,0,,（不是）
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.50,0:03:14.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.96,0:03:23.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,快逃\N{\fnArial\fs30}Run!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.12,0:03:34.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,[邪恶力量 第7季第7集]
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.70,0:03:43.35,Note,0,0,0,0,,（无新信息）
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.86,0:04:07.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊 还真够邋遢的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Geez. Have some pride.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.63,0:04:15.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.36,0:04:17.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,还真是让我饥饿难耐\N{\fnArial\fs30}That make me hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.06,0:04:20.43,Title,0,0,0,0,,你在收听的是香蕉大哥给你带来的《晨叨》\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're listening to the Morning Chaos with me, Bananas Foster.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.43,0:04:21.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,听你个大头鬼 傻帽\N{\fnArial\fs30}The hell I am, ass-hat.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.60,0:04:22.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,接下来是一则诡异的新闻\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now for the news of the weird …
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.71,0:04:25.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,准确地说 是两起非常诡异的谋杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}two very odd murders, to be exact.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.09,0:04:26.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,灵媒镇的灵媒被杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mediums are dying in Lily Dale,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.66,0:04:29.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,灵媒镇是全美最灵异的小镇\N{\fnArial\fs30}the most psychic town in America.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.35,0:04:30.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以如果你想预知自己的未来\N{\fnArial\fs30}So if you want to know your future,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.85,0:04:33.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是找警察吧 总不会只有我想到\N{\fnArial\fs30}stick to that 900 line, 'cause is it me,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.36,0:04:35.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些家伙不是该能预测到未来吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}or should those guys have seen it coming?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.31,0:04:42.24,Note,0,0,0,0,,（纽约州 灵媒镇）
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.46,0:05:29.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦伟大的幽灵啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}O spirits of the further…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.77,0:05:31.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能中劲球彩票吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Am I going to win the Powerball?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.44,0:05:33.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,哥要发财了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna be rich.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.59,0:06:05.48,Note,0,0,0,0,,（灵媒镇年度）
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.48,0:06:06.15,Note,0,0,0,0,,（伊美黛·格瑞文 高迪奶奶 尼克莱·李希安）
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.15,0:06:07.15,Note,0,0,0,0,,（灵媒节）
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.03,0:06:17.70,Note,0,0,0,0,,（恩典咖啡屋 给予你独一无二的一天）
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.34,0:06:21.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.30,0:06:23.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,第一次来恩典咖啡屋吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}First time at good graces?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.49,0:06:25.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.14,0:06:28.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,本店之售本地出产食物 生物动力更绿色\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, we're 100% locally sourced, biodynamic,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.00,0:06:30.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,而你每点一餐可得到免费箴言一条\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you get a free affirmation with every order.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.43,0:06:35.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去找个玉米卷摊好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Think I'll source a taco joint.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.13,0:06:38.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,就要一杯咖啡吧 浓郁黑咖\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just coffee, black, extra shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.43,0:06:44.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你总是穿西服去看手相吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You always wear a suit to get your palm read?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.91,0:06:48.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,也是 你能跑来也是意料之中\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Not surprised you caught this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.73,0:06:51.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,美国早间新闻都播了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's on every morning zoo in America.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.18,0:06:52.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,能坐下吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You mind?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.98,0:06:57.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我 我去过现场了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, I, uh, I went to the scene.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.23,0:06:59.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,电线 音响 电磁读数都高得吓人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wires, speakers, enough E.M.F. to make your hair stand up.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.78,0:07:01.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,给本别想得到净读数\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't even think about getting a reading.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.30,0:07:04.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果不是死了两个灵媒的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, and, uh, if this hadn't have been two psychics that bit it…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.42,0:07:08.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就会把这当做倒霉的意外了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would have just chalked this up as being dumb and accidental.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.03,0:07:09.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然我知道 我懂\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I know, I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.79,0:07:11.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个镇子都是做招鬼的\N{\fnArial\fs30}This whole town's supposedly calling ghosts.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.46,0:07:15.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,但那是需要很厉害的巫术和咒语\N{\fnArial\fs30}But that takes some serious spellwork and some serious mojo.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.57,0:07:17.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,而那女人唯一的一本书却是奥普拉的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The only books this lady had were Oprah crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.94,0:07:20.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你上次碰到真正的灵媒是什么时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}When was the last time you actually saw a real psychic?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.56,0:07:21.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,帕梅拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Huh? Pamela?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.84,0:07:22.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,米苏丽\N{\fnArial\fs30}Missouri?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.21,0:07:25.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管怎样 我们重聚也是好事 你好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anyway, this is good. And, uh, how you been?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.22,0:07:28.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想吃点儿什么呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}And what can I get for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.75,0:07:32.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,薄煎饼 里脊肉 黑咖啡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, pancakes, side of pig. Coffee, black.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.05,0:07:33.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fantastic.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.10,0:07:35.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是神祗的男性体现\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are a virile manifestation of the divine.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.38,0:07:40.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,他该死的说哥什么呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell did he say to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.07,0:07:42.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 很好笑吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, it's funny?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.62,0:07:46.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,行 没事 你笑吧 萨姆 真滑稽\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, no. Go ahead. Laugh it up, Sam. Hilarious.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.26,0:07:51.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.82,0:07:52.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你终于开口了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, he speaks.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.16,0:07:55.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.73,0:07:56.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.28,0:07:59.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 我们都到这儿了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, we're both here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.74,0:08:01.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,这边还在死人\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, the chance of either one of us leaving.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.40,0:08:02.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们就都不会离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}while people are still dying out there …
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.54,0:08:06.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不如忍耐一下跟我一起搞定这件事\N{\fnArial\fs30}you might as well bite the bullet and work with me on this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.58,0:08:08.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道我能不能做到\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know if I can.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.39,0:08:10.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不算是什么难事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not asking you to open up a can of worms.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.06,0:08:10.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,行吗 我都没问你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, I'm not even asking you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.95,0:08:12.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你过去的一周半到底去哪儿了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where the hell you've been for the past week and a half.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.48,0:08:13.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.91,0:08:18.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的意思是 咱们一起阻止杀戮\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just saying, let's try and stop the killings.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.45,0:08:19.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,没别的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.93,0:08:22.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.21,0:08:25.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以吗 很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay? Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.96,0:08:29.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,有什么事吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can I help you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.38,0:08:31.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们是那两兄弟…\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're the brothers from the …
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.03,0:08:32.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是 不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no, no, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.84,0:08:34.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,几周前新闻里的温彻斯特兄弟吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Winchester guys on the news a couple weeks back?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.82,0:08:36.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们被认错很多次了 - 我们不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No … we get that a lot. - Yeah, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.25,0:08:38.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,那俩没人性的杀人狂已经被制裁了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those depraved killers got put down like the dogs that they were.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.42,0:08:41.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们和他们不同 完全无公害\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh. Us on the other hand, we're completely harmless.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.22,0:08:44.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.98,0:08:46.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起 我犯傻了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry. Silly me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.84,0:08:50.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,从你们的气场就能看出来 你们很温和\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I can see by your energies, you're completely gentle.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.02,0:08:53.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,二位请见谅 她很容易激动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse my friend. She's excitable.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.06,0:08:56.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,亲爱的 看清楚了 他们是联调局探员\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sweetheart, look at them, hmm? They're FBI.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.87,0:09:01.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是俄罗斯人 一眼就能认出执法人员\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm Russian. We can spot the law.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.39,0:09:03.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们是来调查那两起惨案的吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You must be here about the tragedies.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.90,0:09:07.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们对发生的事感到十分不安\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, we're just beside ourselves about what happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.08,0:09:09.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 而且快要过节了嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. And so close to festival season, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.13,0:09:10.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah … no …
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.35,0:09:11.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们当然也会担心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course we are worried.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.70,0:09:13.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,但不知道那是怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have no idea what's going on, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.03,0:09:17.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我叫尼克莱 需要我帮忙尽管找我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nikolai. Let me know if I can help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.37,0:09:18.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的直觉力很强\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm highly intuitive.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.66,0:09:20.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,尼克莱·李希安 掰勺师\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nikolai Lishin, spoon bender?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.79,0:09:22.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,世界知名哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}World famous.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.31,0:09:24.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,来灵媒节看我的演示吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come to my demonstration at the festival, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.50,0:09:30.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我教你怎么利用思想的力量\N{\fnArial\fs30}I teach you to harness the power of your mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.93,0:09:34.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧 别打扰他们了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come, let's leave them be.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.92,0:09:40.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,这真是个度假的好地方啊 是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}So glad we decided to vacation here, huh? Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.48,0:09:42.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 看看吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. Here we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.65,0:09:44.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,第一位死者\N{\fnArial\fs30}First death.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.21,0:09:46.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,第二位死者\N{\fnArial\fs30}Second death.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.11,0:09:48.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,有什么重点\N{\fnArial\fs30}What am I looking at?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.25,0:09:49.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,看到这个没\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, see this?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.34,0:09:52.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是一号死者 伊美黛·格瑞文\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, this is Imelda Graven, Death Number One.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.12,0:09:54.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,她被自己的水晶球砸中头部而死\N{\fnArial\fs30}She was brained by her own crystal ball.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.26,0:09:55.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,既无奈又讽刺\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bummer, and ironic.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.36,0:10:00.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,同一条项链吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Same necklace?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.20,0:10:02.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 伊美黛在遗嘱中把它留给了高迪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. See, Imelda gave it to Goldy in her will.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.68,0:10:04.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 这东西可能被诅咒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, so, cursed object, maybe?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.51,0:10:05.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,值得调查一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Worth looking into.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.76,0:10:08.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,高迪的近亲住在镇上 也是个灵媒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Goldy's next of kin lives in town, also a psychic.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.34,0:10:10.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 我的咖啡还没端来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, good. I haven't had my fill.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.46,0:10:19.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,他把我的勺子掰弯了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He broke my spoon.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.52,0:10:32.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是梅勒妮·高迪吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Melanie Golden?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.60,0:10:36.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好 现在有空吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi. Uh…Got a minute?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.82,0:10:39.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,需要我留下陪你吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want me to stay?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.90,0:10:40.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,不用了 没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, that's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.07,0:10:41.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.52,0:10:44.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你过来看我 亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks for stopping by, hon.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.57,0:10:45.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,应该的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.94,0:10:49.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,她是我朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}A friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.86,0:10:51.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,刚刚听说我奶奶的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}She just heard about my grandmother…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.94,0:10:54.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我猜你们也是为这事来的吧 请进吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which is, I guess, why you guys are here, so come on in.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.15,0:10:59.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,不好意思 我刚到家\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry. I just got back.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.18,0:11:01.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你出城了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were out of town?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.25,0:11:04.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 我来回跑 旅馆会场两点一线\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I work the circuit … hotels, conventions, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.21,0:11:06.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh. Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.54,0:11:07.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,无意冒犯 不过…\N{\fnArial\fs30}No offense, but…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.33,0:11:09.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看着不像灵媒\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't seem all that psychic.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.56,0:11:11.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么这么说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why do you say that?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.30,0:11:14.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说 你们家没有…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I mean, just, you know, where's all the…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.77,0:11:16.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,水晶球和金字塔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crystals and pyramids?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.39,0:11:17.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我下班了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm off the clock.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.28,0:11:20.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且我也不是灵媒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Also not psychic.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.16,0:11:23.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了 这是个正当职业\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? It's an honest living.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.82,0:11:25.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,好一个「正当」\N{\fnArial\fs30}Interesting definition of "honest."
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.29,0:11:27.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真的能读懂人的想法\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I honestly read people.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.65,0:11:30.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是靠装神弄鬼 而是通过肢体语言\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just less whoo-whoo, more body language.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.95,0:11:31.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,比如说你们俩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like you two …
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.00,0:11:34.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,搭档很久了 但是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Longtime partners, but, um…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.34,0:11:35.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,关系非常紧张\N{\fnArial\fs30}A lot of tension.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.38,0:11:36.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你很生气\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're pissed.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.46,0:11:38.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你压力很大\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you're stressed.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.41,0:11:40.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,不算很难\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not brain surgery.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.58,0:11:43.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,就因为这个 我和奶奶合不来\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's kind of why my grandma and me didn't get along.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.82,0:11:45.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,别看她平时净说些唬人的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, she'd go full smoke-machine,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.91,0:11:48.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,但还真的相信那些鬼神之事\N{\fnArial\fs30}but she still actually believed in all that stuff, so…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.01,0:11:49.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不信吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.57,0:11:51.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你信吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You do?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.11,0:11:53.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很开通的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've got an open mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.07,0:11:55.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,说出来吓你一跳\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'd be surprised.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.16,0:12:01.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,很抱歉 有件事情要问你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry to have to ask,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.32,0:12:03.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你奶奶有条项链\N{\fnArial\fs30}but there's a necklace of your grandmother's.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.34,0:12:04.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,不在我手上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't have it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.03,0:12:05.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,她的所有东西都送去百货店了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything went straight to the emporium.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.63,0:12:06.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,她和那个老板商量好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}She had a deal with the owner.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.09,0:12:07.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,百货店\N{\fnArial\fs30}The emporium?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.65,0:12:15.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们在找…\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're looking…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.71,0:12:16.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,某样东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}for something.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.09,0:12:17.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真厉害\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're good.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.41,0:12:20.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是「预言师吉米」吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You "Jimmy Tomorrow"?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.22,0:12:21.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在找一条项链\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're looking for a necklace.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.44,0:12:22.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,真浪漫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh. Romantic.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.65,0:12:25.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,是随高迪奶奶的遗物送过来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It would have come in with Grandma Goldy's effects.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.19,0:12:28.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh. Yes, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.03,0:12:32.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们知道这是塞萨利之珠吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, you do know that this is the Orb of Thessaly.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.70,0:12:33.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}We did not know.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.74,0:12:37.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,法力非凡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Very powerful,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.28,0:12:39.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,十分罕见\N{\fnArial\fs30}very rare.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.24,0:12:40.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我猜价格也不菲吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me guess. Very expensive.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.67,0:12:42.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,绝对物有所值\N{\fnArial\fs30}Worth every penny.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.21,0:12:45.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,既然如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, in that case,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.72,0:12:48.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们就把它当做证物征用了\N{\fnArial\fs30}we'll be taking the state's-evidence discount.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.87,0:12:51.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.09,0:12:52.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是谋杀调查\N{\fnArial\fs30}A murder investigation.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.28,0:12:54.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要谢谢你没有妨碍公务\N{\fnArial\fs30}that we'd like to personally thank you for not obstructing.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.65,0:12:57.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,要知道 我做私人看相\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, I give private energetic readings.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.51,0:12:59.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,不必了 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.33,0:13:00.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你失去了什么 这令你不堪重负\N{\fnArial\fs30}A loss weighs on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.63,0:13:02.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你很生气\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're angry.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.62,0:13:04.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,情况很复杂\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's complicated.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.54,0:13:07.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,有空来找我 探员\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come see me, agent.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.23,0:13:10.65,Note,0,0,0,0,,（预言师吉米 私人看相师）
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.36,0:13:17.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你 吉米 回见\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks, Jimmy. We'll see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.25,0:13:20.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,调查局会按价赔偿这条项链吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Bureau's gonna reimburse me for the necklace, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.40,0:13:21.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会给你寄支票的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, we'll send you a check.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.59,0:13:24.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.79,0:13:30.66,Title,0,0,0,0,,他分析你的时候 有点像《超感警探》啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Went a little "Mentalist" on you there, didn't he?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.09,0:13:34.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 下个问题 塞萨利之珠是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. Next question. What's an Orb of Thessaly?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.19,0:13:37.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只知道 这玩意是台湾制造\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know one thing … it's made in Taiwan.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.72,0:13:41.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,在这种地方碰上假货 真稀奇啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, a fake, around here. Imagine that.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.23,0:13:44.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,也就是说杀害灵媒的凶手\N{\fnArial\fs30}'course, that means that whatever's killing mediums.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.67,0:13:45.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,还在逍遥法外\N{\fnArial\fs30}is still out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.61,0:15:03.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,他当时用意念把那些叉子掰弯就好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He probably should have bent those with the power of his mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.53,0:15:06.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,警长\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chief.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.08,0:15:09.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们在警局见过 - 没错 早上好 特工\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We met at the station. - Right. Morning, agent.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.15,0:15:10.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,早上好 这位是伯恩特工\N{\fnArial\fs30}Morning. Uh, this is agent Borne.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.41,0:15:13.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.74,0:15:16.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,挺诡异的 胸腔插满了刀叉\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a weird one. Chest full of cutlery.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.94,0:15:19.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 我们四处察看一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. We're gonna take a look around.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.09,0:15:20.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,发现了什么线索告诉我们一声\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let us know if you get any leads.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.21,0:15:22.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我线索倒是不少\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I got leads coming out of my ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.74,0:15:25.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在才九点 我们的热线已经接了46通电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's 9:00, our tip line had 46 calls,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.77,0:15:28.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,都是开了天眼的人说他们知道发生了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}all from clairvoyants that know what really happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.88,0:15:30.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在流行的说法是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's the popular theory?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.11,0:15:32.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是鬼魂就是\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a toss-up between a ghost.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.73,0:15:35.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,某种专门袭击俄罗斯人的食人恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}and some sort of ogre that only attacks Russians.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.86,0:15:37.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,维持灵媒镇的太平看来挺有趣\N{\fnArial\fs30}Policing Lily Dale sounds fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.51,0:15:39.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,不在这儿就得去洛杉矶了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was either this or Los Angeles.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.59,0:15:42.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么 这些开了天眼的有没有详细说明\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, these clairvoyants, did they give any details.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.71,0:15:45.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么他们认定是鬼魂作案\N{\fnArial\fs30}as to why they thought it was a ghost?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.61,0:15:46.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or a…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.22,0:15:48.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,俄罗斯食人恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Russian ogre?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.45,0:15:50.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们听幽灵说的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Their spirit monkey said so.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.49,0:15:53.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有 这个人声称\N{\fnArial\fs30}Plus, apparently, this guy claims.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.26,0:15:54.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,他曾看到自己死亡的幻象\N{\fnArial\fs30}he had a vision of his own death,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.88,0:15:56.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,刀叉什么都看到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}cutlery and all.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.80,0:16:00.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,不好意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.19,0:16:04.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.78,0:16:08.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,是伯恩特工吗 我是梅勒妮·高迪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Agent Borne? It's Melanie Golden.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.47,0:16:09.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,还好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.37,0:16:11.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说你很开通是真心话吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you mean it when you said you had an open mind?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.57,0:16:16.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我到今天才查看语音信箱\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hadn't checked it until today.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.13,0:16:18.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,唯一往我的座机上打电话的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, the only person who ever called my landline.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.21,0:16:18.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是我的奶奶\N{\fnArial\fs30}was my grandma.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.89,0:16:19.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 继续\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's okay. Go on.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.01,0:16:22.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不敢说这就靠谱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I wouldn't put any stock in it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.32,0:16:23.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说 她经常打电话来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, she was always calling me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.71,0:16:26.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟我说那些她确信是种征兆的疯狂的梦\N{\fnArial\fs30}with some crazy dream she was sure was a sign,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.43,0:16:27.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,诸如此类的事情 可是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}that kind of thing, but…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.07,0:16:32.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,尼克莱真的看到了自己死亡的幻象吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, is it true Nikolai had a real vision of his death?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.79,0:16:33.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,据说是这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what we were told.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.90,0:16:37.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,她也见过 就在她死掉的那天\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, so did she … the day she died.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.71,0:16:38.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,她说什么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What'd she say?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.77,0:16:40.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以听听看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you can listen to it if you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.92,0:16:42.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,她说她当时在招魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}She said she was in a seance,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.80,0:16:44.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,接着灯亮了 十分寒冷\N{\fnArial\fs30}then the lights go, it's freezing.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.74,0:16:46.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 她这么说了吗 房间里面变冷了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, she said that? That the room got cold?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.15,0:16:49.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 怎么了 这很重要吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Why? Is that important?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.41,0:16:51.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了 那是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.45,0:16:53.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,鬼魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}A ghost.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.72,0:16:55.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是闹着玩的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The real deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.74,0:16:57.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.89,0:17:00.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们是认真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're serious.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.08,0:17:04.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 有瞎编装神弄鬼的把戏\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. See, there's, uh, fake whoo-whoo crap,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.25,0:17:06.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,但也有真神真鬼的把戏\N{\fnArial\fs30}and there's real whoo-whoo crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.65,0:17:07.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 可是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, yeah, but…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.64,0:17:10.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,鬼魂吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ghosts?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.72,0:17:11.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,相信我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, trust me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.93,0:17:13.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,比这还诡异的事情多了去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a lot weirder out there than that.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.49,0:17:15.49,Title,0,0,0,0,,那么《X档案》里面讲的是真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}So "The X-Files" is real,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.49,0:17:17.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是你们就是不打联调局的官腔了\N{\fnArial\fs30}or you just stopped talking like an FBI agent.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.05,0:17:19.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,其实…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, um…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.85,0:17:22.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们并不是联调局特工\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're not FBI agents.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.78,0:17:26.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要喝一杯\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need a drink.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.85,0:17:27.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,好主意\N{\fnArial\fs30}I support that.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.07,0:17:34.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果这是一个幽灵干的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, if this is a spirit,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.15,0:17:35.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,那它跟一般附在房子上的鬼魂不一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}it ain't your average spook tied to a house.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.94,0:17:37.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,这东西在整个城镇上游走\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, this thing is boogieing all over town.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.09,0:17:38.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,并不意外\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not surprised.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.90,0:17:41.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说整个灵媒镇\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, how many crystal balls.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.20,0:17:42.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,有多少颗水晶球\N{\fnArial\fs30}do you figure there are in Lily Dale?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.03,0:17:46.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,大概在五十到全世界所有之间吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Somewhere between 50 and, uh, all of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.58,0:17:50.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,水晶可以充当召唤幽灵的天线 对吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I mean, quartz can act as an antenna for spirits, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.31,0:17:52.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,这也是灵媒会\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, that's why mediums.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.38,0:17:54.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,开始使用水晶球的原因\N{\fnArial\fs30}started using crystal balls in the first place.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.67,0:17:56.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,也就是说这镇上的每一个灵媒店\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that means that every storefront in town.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.64,0:17:58.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,都装了一个鬼魂卫星天线\N{\fnArial\fs30}has got a ghost satellite dish.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.89,0:17:59.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.70,0:18:02.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,这地方到处是招鬼的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}And this place is packed with people summoning spirits.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.10,0:18:02.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 可是这当中的大部分人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, but, dude, most of these guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.94,0:18:04.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,甚至连的士都打不到\N{\fnArial\fs30}can't even call a taxi.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.22,0:18:05.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要招来一个就够了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All it takes is one.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.88,0:18:06.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就好像\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's gonna be like.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.62,0:18:08.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,在一堆萝卜里挑人参啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}looking for a needle in a stack of fake needles.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.77,0:18:09.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,比这还糟\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.98,0:18:10.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我敢打赌\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, I'll bet you anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.97,0:18:12.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些人里有人是有真本事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}some of these guys got real juice.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.25,0:18:14.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许没到杀人那么厉害\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not talking kill-people level.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.37,0:18:16.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,但也足够使事情变得复杂\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just saying, enough to make it complicated.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.62,0:18:17.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我讨厌这镇子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hate this town.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.20,0:18:19.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, so, what?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.08,0:18:21.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,向克丽奥斯小姐（美国著名灵媒）求助吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Start hitting up the Miss Cleos?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.36,0:18:22.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在想不如分开排查的好\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was thinking split up and canvass.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.19,0:18:23.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样更快\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's faster.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.46,0:18:28.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 你当然这么想了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right. 'course you were.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.04,0:18:41.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.58,0:18:43.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我哥哥吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}My brother?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.73,0:18:45.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,他又要入狱了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is he going back to prison?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.36,0:18:47.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,离他远点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay away.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.78,0:18:50.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的诅咒会把你拖下水\N{\fnArial\fs30}His curse will drag you down.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.80,0:18:56.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,要知道有的人会把进监狱变成习惯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Folks do turn jail into a habit, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.14,0:19:00.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,别别别\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.18,0:19:02.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要焦急\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't fret.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.18,0:19:04.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我常说\N{\fnArial\fs30}I's always say,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.86,0:19:05.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,家人…\N{\fnArial\fs30}family…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.06,0:19:08.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,反正也让人讨厌\N{\fnArial\fs30}is a pain in the ass anyhow!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.92,0:19:12.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你 喜碧朵姐姐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you, sister Thibideaux.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.18,0:19:14.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,不对 孩纸\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, child.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.93,0:19:18.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,要谢谢那些幽灵\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank the spirits.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.89,0:19:22.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你是给现金还是刷卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, will that be cash or credit?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.44,0:19:46.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.46,0:19:48.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在电话里说了 他能帮上忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like I said on the phone, he can help.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.74,0:19:50.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,冒牌执法者是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Phony lawman, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.66,0:19:53.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 这里就没有冒牌货了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, 'cause nobody can relate to phony around here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.06,0:19:55.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你能帮上什么忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, if you can do something,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.85,0:19:57.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说你是教皇我都不管\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't care if you call yourself the pope.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.58,0:20:00.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 到底发生什么事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. What happened, exactly?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.15,0:20:03.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看到了一个可怕的幻象\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happened is, I had a friggin' vision.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.16,0:20:04.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,有东西冲着我来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something is coming for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.86,0:20:05.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么东西 你看清楚了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's coming? Did you get a look?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.00,0:20:06.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.80,0:20:10.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是当它开始掐断我骨头时 我能分明地感觉到它\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I sure felt it when it started breaking my bones.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.73,0:20:14.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想死\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't want to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.37,0:20:15.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 我们会解决的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. We'll figure it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.71,0:20:16.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是在这看到那些幻象的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}The vision happened in here?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.29,0:20:20.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 在钱箱边\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, by the cash box.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.13,0:20:38.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个「帅哥」可能拍下来了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}There any chance good-lookin' was watching?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.85,0:20:48.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.24,0:20:55.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.64,0:20:58.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的天呐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my god.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.91,0:20:59.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的天呐\N{\fnArial\fs30}oh, my god!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.99,0:21:01.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是…一个真正的\N{\fnArial\fs30}W-was that, I mean, an actual …
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.82,0:21:03.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 名副其实的幽灵\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bona fide. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.01,0:21:06.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,无意冒犯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, no offense,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.31,0:21:08.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是这里没人看到什么幻象\N{\fnArial\fs30}but nobody's having psychic visions around here.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.33,0:21:11.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,一切都是这个幽灵搞出来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}This, uh, spirit, whoever she is, is giving them out.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.00,0:21:14.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后再去杀人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then killing people?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.94,0:21:16.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,除非我们阻止她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Until we stop her.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.92,0:21:17.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过 好消息是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, the good news is.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.88,0:21:19.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说看到一个时钟而且它指向了两点\N{\fnArial\fs30}you said you saw a clock and it read 2:00 a.m.,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.57,0:21:21.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我们还有点时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}so that gives us a little time.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.03,0:21:25.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们有谁认识这个女人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, does anybody recognize this chick?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.43,0:21:27.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我确定我见过她\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, I swear I've seen her,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.69,0:21:29.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,好像是在某幅油画见过\N{\fnArial\fs30}like in a painting or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.53,0:21:30.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,油画吗 比如\N{\fnArial\fs30}A painting? Like, a …
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.95,0:21:32.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不是油画\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, not a painting.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.25,0:21:34.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,在博物馆里的某张老照片里见过\N{\fnArial\fs30}In one of those old photos in the museum.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.55,0:21:44.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,多年来 灵媒镇就是通灵人士的避难所\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lily Dale has long been a haven for the psychically gifted.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.42,0:21:47.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,在别处受尽折磨的人 在此受到欢迎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tortured elsewhere, they're embraced here.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.57,0:21:50.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的家族也有点小小的能力\N{\fnArial\fs30}My own family has a modest natural gift.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.74,0:21:55.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们也有悠久而多彩的历史 并以此为荣\N{\fnArial\fs30}We also celebrate our long and colorful history of…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.90,0:21:58.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就是记录灵异事件\N{\fnArial\fs30}embellishers.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.81,0:22:04.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,灵的外在形象 拍摄于1890年\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ectoplasm illusion, circa 1890.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.19,0:22:12.43,Note,0,0,0,0,,（兄妹联手）
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.34,0:22:27.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些兄弟姐妹的联合总是没什么好下场\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never ended well for the siblings.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.47,0:22:29.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.88,0:22:31.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,一起工作带来的压力\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mm, the strain of working together,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.52,0:22:35.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许只是因为他们一生都与彼此相伴\N{\fnArial\fs30}or maybe just being around each other all their lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.25,0:22:39.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过这两个人可是个例外 坎贝尔兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those two were the exception, actually … the Campbells.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.18,0:22:40.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,关系出名得好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got along famously.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.82,0:22:42.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然 那只是他们的艺名\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course, that was just a stage name.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.65,0:22:44.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们不是真的亲兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}They weren't actually brothers.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.70,0:22:47.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,那只是他们的伪装 用以掩盖\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was a cover for their, um…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.36,0:22:49.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们非传统的生活方式\N{\fnArial\fs30}alternative lifestyle.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.02,0:22:53.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还能解答你们什么问题吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Any other questions I can answer?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.73,0:22:55.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 她们是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes. Who are they?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.73,0:22:59.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,她们是福克斯姐妹 也是灵媒镇的创始人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, the Fox sisters … among the founders of Lily Dale.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.66,0:23:01.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯特·福克斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kate Fox …
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.31,0:23:02.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,多苦多难\N{\fnArial\fs30}quite troubled, apparently,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.97,0:23:05.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,但在台上极具魅惑\N{\fnArial\fs30}but mesmerizing onstage.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.14,0:23:08.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,据说她可以隔空取物\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's said to be able to levitate objects.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.01,0:23:10.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,预知人的生死\N{\fnArial\fs30}and foretell one's death.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.07,0:23:11.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是那边那个\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's her.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.66,0:23:13.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,她的姐姐 玛格丽特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Her older sister, Margaret …
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.34,0:23:15.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有什么通灵的能力\N{\fnArial\fs30}perhaps not a natural psychic.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.64,0:23:16.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就是神棍\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, full of crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.27,0:23:18.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,算是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, well…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.51,0:23:20.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,虽然她没有她妹妹的能力\N{\fnArial\fs30}She didn't have her sister's charisma,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.85,0:23:23.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,但她照看着凯特\N{\fnArial\fs30}but she looked after Kate.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.57,0:23:27.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,有时候 一个人真正的天赋是照顾别人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sometimes, one's true gift is taking care of others.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.95,0:23:31.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,那她们后来怎么样了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what happened to them?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.05,0:23:32.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,一直住在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lived here all their lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.53,0:23:33.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,生活在这儿 也死在这儿吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lived here and died here?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.13,0:23:37.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 埋在公墓里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, well… buried in the cemetery.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.53,0:23:40.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好 受教了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Great. That was very educational.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.49,0:23:41.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.37,0:23:42.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.60,0:23:46.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.42,0:23:48.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,通常我不在上班时间干这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't normally do this during business hours,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.83,0:23:51.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你认识叫埃莉诺\N{\fnArial\fs30}but do you know an Eleanor…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.61,0:23:53.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者埃伦的人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}or an Ellen?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.88,0:23:57.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,她似乎很担心你\N{\fnArial\fs30}She seems quite concerned about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.23,0:23:59.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,她想告诉你\N{\fnArial\fs30}She wants to tell you …
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.88,0:24:01.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,请原谅我\N{\fnArial\fs30}pardon me …
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.66,0:24:05.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你不告诉某人情况到底有多糟\N{\fnArial\fs30}if you don't tell someone how bad it really is,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.83,0:24:08.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,她会穿越灵界踢死你\N{\fnArial\fs30}she'll kick your ass from beyond.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.55,0:24:11.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你终究得重新相信某人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have to trust someone again eventually.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.33,0:24:18.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管怎么样 别忘了来礼品店逛逛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anyway, don't forget to visit the gift shop.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.41,0:24:26.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.67,0:24:28.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,去墓地 挖凯特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hit up the graveyard, dig up Kate?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.20,0:24:29.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. Wait a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.35,0:24:30.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有证据都指向她了 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}All signs point to her, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.61,0:24:32.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 给我等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. Just hold on a damn minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.06,0:24:35.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,别管什么「事实」了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Enough with "just the facts."
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.81,0:24:36.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们说好\N{\fnArial\fs30}We agreed …
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.41,0:24:37.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我们说好一起查这件事\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, we agreed to work the case.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.41,0:24:39.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们没说好你可以一直臭着脸\N{\fnArial\fs30}We didn't agree for you to be a dick the whole time.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.98,0:24:40.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.01,0:24:43.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在生我气 对吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're pissed, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.56,0:24:44.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你也有权生气 - 当然了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And you've got a right. - Yeah, damn straight.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.91,0:24:46.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 但你也够了吧 - 谁说的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- But enough's enough. - Says who?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.21,0:24:48.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 我会继续查这个案子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I'll work this damn case,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.55,0:24:52.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你对我撒谎 杀了我的朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}but you lied to me, and you killed my friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.43,0:24:57.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我只是杀了一个血染四命的怪物\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I put down a monster who killed four people,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.72,0:24:59.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你不认识她的话 你也会这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}and if you didn't know her, you'd have done the Same thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.41,0:25:00.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我认识她 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}I did know her, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.19,0:25:01.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 所以你才下不了手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, which is why you couldn't do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.17,0:25:04.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 我理解\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.22,0:25:05.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,世界上就是有些人\N{\fnArial\fs30}There are certain people in this world,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.19,0:25:07.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管他们是多么危险 你就是下不了手\N{\fnArial\fs30}no matter how dangerous they are, you just can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.13,0:25:09.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,别来这套 都是废话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't pull that card. That's bull.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.83,0:25:11.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果说我长了什么教训\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, if I've learned one thing,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.14,0:25:12.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就是什么事感觉不对\N{\fnArial\fs30}it's that if something feels wrong,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.36,0:25:13.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,那它很有可能就是错的\N{\fnArial\fs30}it probably is!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.58,0:25:16.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,通常来说没错 但杀死艾米可没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Usually, yeah. But killing Amy was not wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.53,0:25:18.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你下不了手 所以我来\N{\fnArial\fs30}You couldn't do it, so I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.63,0:25:20.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是家人 为你干脏活儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what family does … the dirty work.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.57,0:25:23.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也会把事情全部告诉你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I would have told you eventually,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.16,0:25:24.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我得确认你发神经「举枪打撒旦」的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}once I knew that this whole "waving a gun at satan" thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.92,0:25:26.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,以后不会再犯了\N{\fnArial\fs30}was a one-time show.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.96,0:25:28.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我认为这不算无理的要求\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think it's reasonable to want to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.93,0:25:30.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有权知道你是不是还疯着 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}that you're off the friggin' high dive, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.42,0:25:32.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你差点把我们都害死\N{\fnArial\fs30}You almost got us both killed,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.09,0:25:33.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你大可随意发火\N{\fnArial\fs30}so you can be pissed all you want,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.52,0:25:34.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,但别再唧唧歪歪\N{\fnArial\fs30}but quit being a bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.43,0:26:01.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我懂她为什么杀人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I get why she's killing people.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.08,0:26:03.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不懂为什么她先警告他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't get why she's warning them.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.63,0:26:09.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许是让他们常常诅咒的滋味\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give them a taste of the curse, maybe?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.27,0:26:13.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,这可没什么乐趣\N{\fnArial\fs30}It couldn't have been a joyride.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.20,0:26:15.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.63,0:26:22.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.98,0:26:23.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,走开 疯女人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Back off, crazy eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.98,0:26:25.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,听我说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.14,0:26:27.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么没人听我说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why isn't anybody listening?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.39,0:26:28.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.24,0:26:29.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,这事你说了不算\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't get a vote.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.33,0:26:30.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 住手\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.02,0:26:31.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.04,0:26:35.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.20,0:26:42.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,好时机\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice timing.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.70,0:26:47.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.37,0:26:49.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}And, Dean, thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.79,0:26:52.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们都弄好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They took care of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.93,0:26:56.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,那\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, so…
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.07,0:26:59.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,就直接回家了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What … just go home?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.08,0:27:01.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,应该是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.23,0:27:07.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你愿意来跟我住上几天吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, why don't you come stay with me a couple days?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.03,0:27:08.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.18,0:27:13.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,再等一会儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just one more minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.55,0:27:14.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事的 亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's fine, hon.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.53,0:27:15.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你看到那些幻象\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, if you had that vision,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.89,0:27:17.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也不想呆在这儿的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You wouldn't want to be here either.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.43,0:27:29.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡蜜尔 没事的 我们快走就是了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Camille, it's okay. Let's just go.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.35,0:27:35.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.48,0:27:41.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,再给他们打电话 快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Call them back! Now!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.54,0:27:44.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,梅勒妮\N{\fnArial\fs30}Melanie?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.12,0:27:45.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩 你们得回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, you have to come back.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.64,0:27:46.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.13,0:27:48.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是出事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's still happening!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.27,0:27:49.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 什么叫还是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, what do you mean it's …
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.19,0:27:51.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,她还是要来 快告诉我该做点什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's still coming! Just tell me what the hell to do!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.65,0:27:52.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 听我说 冷静下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. Listen to me. Calm down.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.54,0:27:54.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩 把电话给我 你好好开车\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, just give me the phone and drive.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.42,0:27:56.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,梅勒妮 去厨房\N{\fnArial\fs30}Melanie? Hey. Get to the kitchen.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.36,0:27:57.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.69,0:28:00.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,她来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's here!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.63,0:28:02.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,只管去厨房 找些盐来\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, just go. Get salt.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.81,0:28:11.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,起作用了 她走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It worked. She's gone!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.69,0:28:15.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 她又回来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, she's back!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.06,0:28:17.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,盐用完了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm out of salt!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.41,0:28:19.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,找铁器 有壁炉吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Find iron. Is there a fireplace?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.23,0:28:20.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,梅勒妮\N{\fnArial\fs30}Melanie!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.55,0:28:33.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊 梅尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, god! Mel!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.08,0:28:37.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡蜜尔 卡蜜尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Camille! Camille!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.94,0:28:39.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡蜜尔 不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}Camille! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.60,0:29:00.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们早该知道那个「好妹妹 坏姐姐」的故事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Should have known that whole "Good sis, bad sis" story.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.56,0:29:02.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,是揽客手段\N{\fnArial\fs30}was just showmanship crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.45,0:29:05.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,结果凯特只是想警告人们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, and it turns out that Kate was just trying to warn people.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.42,0:29:07.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,她妹妹才是那个邪恶的婊子\N{\fnArial\fs30}about her evil bitch sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.10,0:29:08.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,而我们却一把火烧得她灰飞烟灭\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we burned her bones,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.44,0:29:09.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,这回没人警告我们了\N{\fnArial\fs30}so that's gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.16,0:29:10.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 迪恩 - 干嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Dean. - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.24,0:29:11.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们现在能做的就是阻止她\N{\fnArial\fs30}All we can do now is go stop her.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.71,0:29:13.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,这主意真不好 离好主意差远了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's not good enough, by a mile.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.21,0:29:14.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,相信我 我也知道 但是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know. Believe me. But …
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.96,0:29:15.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们能不能晚点再说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can we talk about this later?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.19,0:29:19.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}How you holding up?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.41,0:29:21.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,不太好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Been better.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.13,0:29:23.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你要我们离开的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, if you need for us to leave …
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.33,0:29:24.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要你们俩离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need you guys to leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.94,0:29:25.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 我们会走的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, we will.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.83,0:29:26.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,只不过\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just that…
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.50,0:29:29.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,玛格丽特还在外面兴风作浪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look … Margaret is still out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.66,0:29:33.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们想知道些什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you guys need to know?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.25,0:29:36.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,昨晚有没有发生什么特别的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is there anything that stood out?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.41,0:29:43.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,她几乎看都没看我一眼\N{\fnArial\fs30}She barely gave a crap about me.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.86,0:29:45.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我好像只是挡路了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, I was just in the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.20,0:29:47.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,她只想抓住卡蜜尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}She was all about getting Camille.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.33,0:29:49.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好的 有点线索了 - 还有件事\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Okay. That's something. - One other thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.73,0:29:51.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,她很享受\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um…She enjoyed it.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.89,0:29:54.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,她当时在笑\N{\fnArial\fs30}She was smiling.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.10,0:30:04.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,大白天的做这事也太暴露了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I feel naked doing this in daylight.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.89,0:30:06.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点就是了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Let's just hurry up.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.50,0:30:24.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 玛格斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, Mags.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.87,0:30:27.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,这次我的打火机可已经加过油了\N{\fnArial\fs30}My lighter's juiced this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.96,0:30:36.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,太棒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Geraldo'd.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.17,0:30:37.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,情况不妙啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not good.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.07,0:30:38.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,一向都是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never good.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.48,0:30:40.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩 如果有人知道要偷走玛格丽特的尸骨\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, if someone knew enough to take Margaret's bones,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.34,0:30:41.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,那可不是闹着玩的\N{\fnArial\fs30}they're not kidding around.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.52,0:30:43.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是很厉害的捆绑咒\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's serious binding magic.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.83,0:30:45.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,太好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.23,0:30:48.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,灵媒贱鬼被人控制了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Psychic ghost bitch on a leash.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.38,0:30:49.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得找到她的尸骨\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got to find those bones.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.57,0:30:51.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我们就得找到那个笨蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}So we got to find the bonehead.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.45,0:30:53.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,那怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.11,0:30:55.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,打电话给鲍比 查查如何控制鬼魂的力量吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}We call Bobby, see what it takes to harness the power of a ghost?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.72,0:30:57.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.39,0:31:03.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆 你知道为什么我不要把钱花在\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Sam, you know why I'm not going to spend my money.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.90,0:31:06.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,灵媒镇一年一度的灵媒节\N{\fnArial\fs30}at the annual Lily Dale E.S.P. Festival.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.21,0:31:08.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有今年的吃热狗比赛上吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}and Hot-Dog-Eating Contest this year?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.11,0:31:09.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,还真想不出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can't imagine.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.68,0:31:12.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为所有的头牌都死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because all the headliners are dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.42,0:31:14.76,Note,0,0,0,0,,（灵媒节）
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.05,0:31:22.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,尼克莱死后\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, after Nikolai…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.71,0:31:26.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们让卡蜜尔来接替他的位子\N{\fnArial\fs30}they asked Camille to take his spot.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.15,0:31:28.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,她广受欢迎\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, she's so popular.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.25,0:31:30.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,生前广受欢迎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Was so popular.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.58,0:31:32.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有的死者 你会说他们是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, all these people … would you say that they're.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.90,0:31:35.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,是镇上最好的灵媒吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}the, uh, you know, top dogs in town?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.16,0:31:36.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,也不能这么说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, it's not really like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:36.86,0:31:38.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过他们的确很受欢迎 就像你奶奶\N{\fnArial\fs30}But they were all doing well. I mean, your grandma?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.92,0:31:40.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,她是写过几本书\N{\fnArial\fs30}She wrote a few books.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.23,0:31:43.03,Title,0,0,0,0,,伊美黛也上过两次《内特·博克斯秀》\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, and Imelda was on "The Nate Berkus Show" twice,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.04,0:31:45.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想他们的确很受欢迎\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, yeah, I guess they were doing pretty well.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.26,0:31:48.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得这就是她追杀他们的原因吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think that's why she went after them?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.15,0:31:50.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果让你猜的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, if you had to guess,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.28,0:31:51.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得谁会是下一个上榜的人呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}who do you think would be next in line?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.96,0:31:54.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.19,0:31:56.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的奶奶都上海报了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, your grandma was headlining at the big hall,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.51,0:31:58.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以快想想他们会让谁接替她的位子\N{\fnArial\fs30}So who do you think they would ask to fill in for her?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.46,0:31:59.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Probably…
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.85,0:32:03.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我\N{\fnArial\fs30}…me.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.99,0:32:09.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,特工 你是来把支票给我的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Agent. Are you here with my check?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.95,0:32:11.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来找一个到你这里来买过东西的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm looking for someone who bought some things from you.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.71,0:32:13.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么知道是从我这里买的\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do you know from me?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.95,0:32:16.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想加油站是不会卖灰木圣坛的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm kind of doubting they sell ash-wood altars at the gas 'n sip.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.44,0:32:18.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,确实\N{\fnArial\fs30}Valid.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.59,0:32:19.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我看看这张单子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me see the list.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.09,0:32:29.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,有了 信用卡支付收据\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah. Here we go. Credit-card receipt.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.15,0:32:31.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想你还要那人的地址吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I assume you want the address?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.30,0:32:32.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,那真是太好了 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}That would be great. Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.64,0:32:34.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是尽我绵薄之力\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the least I can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.38,0:32:38.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我刚听说了卡蜜尔·喜碧朵的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just heard about Camille Thibideaux.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.11,0:32:40.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,太感谢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:43.46,0:32:44.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,不客气\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.06,0:32:52.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,你确定那有效吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you sure that'll work?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.53,0:32:55.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,应该足够拖住她\N{\fnArial\fs30}That should hold her off long enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.46,0:32:57.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,让萨姆找到她的尸骨然后一把火烧了\N{\fnArial\fs30}for Sam to find the bones and burn them.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.90,0:32:58.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,希望如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hopefully.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.31,0:33:00.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,希望如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hopefully?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.13,0:33:02.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们会疼吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Does it hurt 'em?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.07,0:33:04.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,烧掉他们尸骨的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}Burning their bones?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.54,0:33:07.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还真没考虑过这事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I never really thought about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.41,0:33:10.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能会吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Probably, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.35,0:33:12.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.90,0:33:25.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,圣坛在哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's the altar?!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.66,0:33:28.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,就在那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's there!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:34.09,0:33:35.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're…
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.34,0:33:36.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是个巫师\N{\fnArial\fs30}not a necromancer.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.54,0:33:39.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是个心理助产班 我发誓\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is a lamaze class, I swear.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.61,0:33:40.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我 我相信你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I-I believe you.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:41.23,0:33:42.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:48.83,0:33:50.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩 是那个当铺的家伙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, it's the pawn-shop guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.24,0:33:50.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么知道的\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.85,0:33:54.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,他把我骗到一个孕妇瑜伽班去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He goose-chased me to a friggin' pregnant yoga class.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.38,0:33:56.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,查出他把她的尸骨藏在哪里了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, well, figure out where he put her bones.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.53,0:33:57.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.32,0:33:59.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,速度啊 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fast, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.14,0:34:12.60,Note,0,0,0,0,,（「预言师吉米」 私人看相师 未来是美好的 美国 纽约 灵媒镇 主街 809 1/2）
Dialogue: 0,0:34:58.19,0:35:00.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知怎的 我就知道你会回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Somehow, I just knew you'd be back.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.64,0:35:10.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好啊 特工 把头骨放下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi, agent. Put the skull down.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:10.26,0:35:12.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 好 放松 给\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, okay. Take it easy. Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.41,0:35:17.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 你该收手了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. That's enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:18.66,0:35:20.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 她走了 - 不见得\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Is she gone? - I doubt it.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.96,0:35:22.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是她不能过线的 对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}But she can't get past the line, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.20,0:35:23.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,对的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:28.30,0:35:29.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,捆绑咒施得不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice binding spell.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:29.42,0:35:30.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这样无济于事\N{\fnArial\fs30}It doesn't matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:31.61,0:35:33.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,她是出于自愿帮我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}She helps me because she wants to.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:34.23,0:35:35.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:37.20,0:35:39.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,见鬼 我就讨厌他们干这事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn it. I hate when they do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:39.45,0:35:40.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,去拿盐撒圈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get the salt. Go.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:43.31,0:35:44.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:49.45,0:35:52.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,玛格丽特和我一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Margaret and me are the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.81,0:35:54.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都有真把式\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're the real thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:55.18,0:35:56.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是你猜怎么\N{\fnArial\fs30}But guess what …
Dialogue: 0,0:35:56.57,0:35:58.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,有时候真把式\N{\fnArial\fs30}sometimes the real thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.36,0:36:01.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,并不是那么好看好玩的\N{\fnArial\fs30}just isn't pretty or entertaining enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:05.21,0:36:08.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,当我向人们展示能力时 他们吓坏了\N{\fnArial\fs30}When I show people what I'm capable of, it scares them.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:09.04,0:36:10.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我连租金都付不出\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't pay my rent!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.54,0:36:16.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,到我身后来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get behind me.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:17.87,0:36:19.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,别想往前走了 婊子\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's as far as you go, bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:19.23,0:36:20.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,玛格丽特很高兴为我杀人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Margaret's happy to kill for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:21.43,0:36:22.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,她喜欢束缚\N{\fnArial\fs30}She likes the leash.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.57,0:36:24.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真有病\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're sick.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:24.45,0:36:25.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,除此之外呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what else I am?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:26.47,0:36:28.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还是个真正的灵媒 你个白痴\N{\fnArial\fs30}A real psychic, you dick-bag.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:31.54,0:36:32.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,惊喜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Surprise.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:42.04,0:36:43.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起 帅哥\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry, handsome.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:45.13,0:36:46.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,她其他的骨头在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are the rest of the bones?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.99,0:37:01.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些人命不该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}These people don't deserve to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:01.92,0:37:03.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,天哪 你在搞笑吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, come on! Are you kidding me?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:03.91,0:37:07.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,就因为我没像他们那样唬人 就该生活困窘吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I live in squalor cause I can't put on a show like them?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.16,0:37:08.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,别这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.17,0:37:12.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 骨头在卧室 对吗 - 不对\N{\fnArial\fs30}- They're in the bedroom, aren't they? - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:15.33,0:37:16.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不能过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not getting in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:30.95,0:37:32.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:38.19,0:37:39.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,真不幸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Too bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:05.91,0:38:07.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,在床上\N{\fnArial\fs30}In the bed?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:07.73,0:38:09.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,骨头放在床上\N{\fnArial\fs30}They were in the bed?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:09.24,0:38:09.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:09.86,0:38:12.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,他居然连骨头都不放过\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't believe he was boning her.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:12.81,0:38:13.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:13.82,0:38:15.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,还需要点别的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can I get you anything else?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:15.37,0:38:16.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,再满一杯吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, just a refill.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:16.47,0:38:19.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说什么箴言 我就揍你\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if you affirmate me, I'm gonna punch you in the face.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:23.49,0:38:25.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 咖啡马上到\N{\fnArial\fs30}All righty then. coffee, coming up.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:28.04,0:38:29.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真想快点摆脱这个算命镇\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't wait to get out of this frickin' fortune cookie.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:30.91,0:38:31.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:35.42,0:38:36.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna go, um…
Dialogue: 0,0:38:36.94,0:38:38.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,随便逛逛吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}do something outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:38.38,0:38:39.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:41.86,0:38:42.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,请坐吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi. Have a seat.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:42.92,0:38:43.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:47.25,0:38:49.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你都没给我时间道谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}You didn't stick around so I could say thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:50.48,0:38:51.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,不用谢我\N{\fnArial\fs30}No reason to thank me.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:52.29,0:38:53.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你救了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You saved my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.94,0:38:55.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是没救成你朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, but not your friend's.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:56.55,0:38:58.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,又不是你召的鬼 所以\N{\fnArial\fs30}You didn't send that ghost, so…
Dialogue: 0,0:38:58.59,0:39:00.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你来杀了它\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you for coming to kill it.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:03.60,0:39:05.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你和萨姆的关系似乎有所缓和\N{\fnArial\fs30}You and sam seem a little better.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:07.03,0:39:08.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,这么短时间你就能看出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}You could tell that from the walk up?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:09.09,0:39:10.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,信不信由你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take it or leave it.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:11.16,0:39:14.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我猜你不会再回来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Also guessing you're not so keen to come visit here again,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:14.19,0:39:16.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以 这就算道别吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}So…this is goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:18.42,0:39:20.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,真希望我们相遇的这周不这么糟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wish we'd met on a better week.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:21.02,0:39:22.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我希望我能有一周不这么糟\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wish I had better weeks.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:23.10,0:39:25.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是 说不准会有呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}But, uh, hey. You never know.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:25.73,0:39:27.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你又不能预知未来 对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not like you can tell the future, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:32.50,0:39:34.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 很模糊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, answer's hazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:35.20,0:39:36.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,以后再试吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Try again later.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:38.41,0:39:39.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}right.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:48.31,0:39:49.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是你的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's your stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:50.28,0:39:52.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 我想我们还是坐一辆车吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Yeah. I figured we'd take one car.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.70,0:39:57.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没意见 你还想打残我的脸吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Works for me. You still want to break my face?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:59.00,0:40:01.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,不了 目前不想\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. Not at this moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:01.44,0:40:02.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, you know what?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:04.85,0:40:05.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是对的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were right.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:06.22,0:40:07.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾米的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}About Amy.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:07.86,0:40:09.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果她\N{\fnArial\fs30}If she was…
Dialogue: 0,0:40:09.72,0:40:10.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是个路人妖怪\N{\fnArial\fs30}just any monster,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:10.96,0:40:14.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就不会那么轻易放她走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not sure I could have let her walk away.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:14.19,0:40:15.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也说不好 我永远都不会知道了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know. I mean, I'll never know.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:16.31,0:40:17.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你是什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what are you saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:17.14,0:40:18.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的意思是\N{\fnArial\fs30}What I'm saying is…
Dialogue: 0,0:40:19.44,0:40:20.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我理解你为什么这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}I get why you did it.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:21.01,0:40:23.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你只是为了保证没有别人会再受伤害\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were just trying to make sure no one else got hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:23.80,0:40:24.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,但问题在于\N{\fnArial\fs30}But here's the thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:24.84,0:40:26.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不能就这么看着我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't just look me in the face.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:26.41,0:40:27.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,对我说你没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}and tell me you're fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:28.08,0:40:30.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说 你失眠 还大量饮酒\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, you're not sleeping, you drink for the record …
Dialogue: 0,0:40:30.24,0:40:31.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,又来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, here we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:31.04,0:40:33.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道我没资格来说你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, whatever. Last one to preach. I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:33.04,0:40:35.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是 跟我说实话\N{\fnArial\fs30}But… just be honest with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:35.61,0:40:36.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这副样子\N{\fnArial\fs30}How are those the actions of someone.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:36.68,0:40:38.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么可能分清是非\N{\fnArial\fs30}who knows they did the right thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:38.23,0:40:39.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想听实话\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want me to be honest?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:39.35,0:40:40.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我跟着感觉走\N{\fnArial\fs30}I went with my gut.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:41.16,0:40:42.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且我感觉不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that felt right.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:43.55,0:40:44.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不信任她 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't trust her, sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:46.72,0:40:47.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,自从小卡之后\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course, ever since cass,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:47.58,0:40:49.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就很难再相信任何人了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm having a hard time trusting anybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:50.65,0:40:52.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,至于我的行为\N{\fnArial\fs30}And as far as how I been acting…
Dialogue: 0,0:40:55.22,0:40:56.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:56.05,0:40:57.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许是不想对你撒谎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe it's 'cause I don't like lying to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:58.22,0:40:59.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,感觉不对劲\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, it doesn't feel right.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:00.45,0:41:03.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以你猜对了 我最近是很焦虑\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, yeah, you got me there. I been climbing the walls.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:03.37,0:41:04.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个我有体会\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know how that is.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:08.82,0:41:09.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是\N{\fnArial\fs30}But, hey…
Dialogue: 0,0:41:10.02,0:41:12.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果说我从博物馆那里学到了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I learned one thing from that museum,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:12.27,0:41:13.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,兄弟联手并非易事\N{\fnArial\fs30}sibling acts are tough.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:13.52,0:41:15.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,别把咱俩和那帮疯子比\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, don't compare us to that hall of crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:16.46,0:41:20.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟他们相比 我们就是正常家庭的代言人了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're like poster kids of functional family life compared to them.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:20.09,0:41:21.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,标准有点低\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a low bar.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:21.78,0:41:23.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,曲线分级评分法从幼儿园就助我及格了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Grading on a curve has got me past everything since kindergarten,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:23.97,0:41:24.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,就别挑刺了\N{\fnArial\fs30}so don't knock it.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:24.71,0:41:25.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,随你吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever you say.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:31.15,0:41:33.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还是想知道那家伙怎么弯汤勺的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I still want to know how that guy bent my spoon.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:34.37,0:41:36.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,别惦记了 萨姆 这里是灵媒镇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Forget it, sam. It's Lily Dale.
